utive chairman of McCourt Global and founder of Project Liberty, today announced that net proceeds from his forthcoming book “OUR BIGGEST FIGHT: Reclaiming Liberty, Humanity, and Dignity in the Digital Age,” will be donated to the Project Liberty Foundation, a 501(c)(3) organization working to advance the responsible development of technology and ensure that tomorrow’s internet is designed and governed for the common good. OUR BIGGEST FIGHT, co-authored with journalist Michael Casey, will be published by Crown Publishing Group, a division of Penguin Random House, on March 12, 2024, and is currently available for pre-sale. \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSmart Money: How Digital Currencies Will Shape the New World Order: Brunello Rosa: Bloomsbury Publishing - Bloomsbury (https://www.bloomsbury.com/us/smart-money-9781526675873/)\nciteturn352search5 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.9 years ago; Crawled: 2 weeks ago; \n\nGo back\n\n##### Select a format\n\n[Input]\n\nPaperback\n\n~~$19.99~~ $17.99\n\n[Input]\n\nHardback\n\n~~$29.99~~ $26.99\n\n[Input]\n\nEbook (PDF)\n\n$15.99\n\n[Input]\n\nEbook (Epub & Mobi)\n\n$15.99\n\n[Input]\n\nAudiobook\n\n~~$21.00~~ $10.50\n\n# Smart Money\n\n### How Digital Currencies Will Shape the New World Order\n\nBrunello Rosa (Author) , Casey Larsen (Author)\n\nImage: Look Inside\n\n  * Share\n  *   *   *   *   * # Smart Money\n\nHow Digital Currencies Will Shape the New World Order\n\nBrunello Rosa (Author) , Casey Larsen (Author)\n\nPaperback ~~$19.99~~ $17.99 Hardback ~~$29.99~~ $26.99 Ebook (PDF) $15.99 Ebook (Epub & Mobi) $15.99 Audiobook ~~$21.00~~ $10.50\n\nHardback - $̶2̶9̶.̶9̶9̶, $26.99▾\n\n  * Paperback - $̶1̶9̶.̶9̶9̶, $17.99\n  * Hardback - $̶2̶9̶.̶9̶9̶, $26.99\n  * Ebook (PDF) - $15.99\n  * Ebook (Epub & Mobi) - $15.99\n  * Audiobook - $̶2̶1̶.̶0̶0̶, $10.50\n\n[Input]\n\nOut of stock\n\n$26.99 RRP $29.99 Website price saving $3.00 (10%)\nChina was the first country to recognise t